      "id": "joins",
      "status": "pass",
      "detail": "generated reads are single-table (0/4 joins); lookup display needs one fetch per lookup (confirm with P-JOIN)"
    },
    {
      "id": "org-tables",
      "status": "pass",
      "detail": "this app creates 9 Data Store table(s); an org-wide limit on table creates refuses a create with 403 API_LIMIT_REACHED \"API Limit for table\" — on that refusal stop creates, keep created tables, and retry after 30/60/120 minutes; a project delete may not free capacity at once"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-row-cap",
      "status": "warn",
      "detail": "the per-table row estimate needs source row counts; Development's per-table row cap is a hidden value (datastore.rows_per_table_dev, the value is not published) — a load refused with 403 API_LIMIT_REACHED \"API Limit for row\" is the signal",
      "fix": "re-run c2c plan with --source-backup, --source-csv or --source-json so the budget lists the largest tables; rehearse a large load on a different environment before cutover"
    },
    {
      "id": "varchar-length",
      "status": "warn",
      "detail": "source string values are unmeasured; a REST insert silently truncates past a varchar column's length (measured ceiling 255) — validate before write; counts are JavaScript code points — whether Catalyst counts emoji, multibyte characters or CRLF line endings the same way is unverified",
      "fix": "re-run c2c plan with --source-backup, --source-csv or --source-json so the budget measures source string values against varchar column lengths"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-api-calls",
      "status": "warn",
      "detail": "the mover's API-call estimate needs source row counts; Development allows 200000 API calls per application (api.calls_dev, docs figure)",
      "fix": "re-run c2c plan with --source-backup, --source-csv or --source-json so the estimate counts the mover reads and writes"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-write-rate",
      "status": "pass",
      "detail": "no source row counts — the dev-api-calls budget carries the missing-source warning; the stated Development write rate is ~100 writes/min/table (datastore.write_requests_per_minute, unverified)",
      "fix": "re-run c2c plan with --source-backup, --source-csv or --source-json so both estimates count the mover calls; run c2c probe P-RATE before a large load"
    }
  ],
  "budgetsOk": true,
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "import",
      "via": "cli",
      "command": "c2c provision --confirm --run import",
      "args": {
        "name": "c2c-kitchen-sink-studio",
        "environment": "Development",
        "app": "Kitchen_Sink_Studio",
        "dir": "provision/iac",
        "note": "the bundle ships the dry-run c2c_api without bundled dependencies — run c2c deploy --confirm after provisioning to install the live function"
      },
      "readBack": {
        "via": "cli",
        "command": "c2c provision --record import",
        "match": {
          "project_name": "<import-name>",
          "id": "<project>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cloudscale-enable",
      "via": "console",
      "command": "Catalyst console → the project → Cloud Scale → Start Exploring (<console>/baas/<org>/project/<project>/Development#/cloudscale) — then c2c verifies it: c2c provision --record cloudscale-enable (GET /baas/v1/project/<project>/table)",
      "args": {
        "service": "Cloud Scale"
      },
      "readBack": {
        "via": "cli",
        "command": "c2c provision --record cloudscale-enable",
        "args": {
          "call": {
            "method": "GET",
            "path": "/baas/v1/project/<project>/table"
          }
        },
        "match": {
          "gate": "open"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tables",
      "via": "cli",
      "command": "c2c provision --confirm --run tables",
      "args": {
        "plan": "provision/tables.json",
        "tables": [
          "Room",
          "Gear",
          "Session_Log",
          "Booking__Lines",
          "Booking",
          "Guest",
          "Media_Kit",
          "Booking__Gear_Refs",
          "C2CJobCheckpoint"
        ]
      },
      "readBack": {
        "via": "mcp",
        "tool": "CatalystbyZoho_List_All_Tables",
        "match": {
          "table_name": [
            "Room",
            "Gear",
            "Session_Log",
            "Booking__Lines",
            "Booking",
            "Guest",
            "Media_Kit",
            "Booking__Gear_Refs",
            "C2CJobCheckpoint"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "import-table-permissions",
      "via": "mcp",
      "tool": "CatalystbyZoho_Get_Table_Permissions",
      "args": {
        "path_variables": {
          "projectId": "<project>"
        },
        "headers": {
          "Catalyst-org": "<org>",
          "Environment": "Development"
        },
        "calls": [
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Room>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Gear>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Session_Log>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Booking__Lines>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Booking>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Guest>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Media_Kit>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:Booking__Gear_Refs>"
            }
          },
          {
            "path_variables": {
              "id": "<id:C2CJobCheckpoint>"
            }
          }
        ],
        "note": "the IaC import set these grants; this step only proves them — a mismatch means the import did not apply them"
      },
      "readBack": {
        "via": "mcp",
        "tool": "CatalystbyZoho_Get_Table_Permissions",
        "args": {
          "path_variables": {
            "projectId": "<project>"
          },
          "headers": {
            "Catalyst-org": "<org>",
            "Environment": "Development"
          },
          "calls": [
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Room>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Gear>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Session_Log>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Booking__Lines>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Booking>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Guest>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Media_Kit>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:Booking__Gear_Refs>"
              }
            },
            {
              "path_variables": {
                "id": "<id:C2CJobCheckpoint>"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "match": {
          "<id:Room>": {
            "App Administrator": [
              "SELECT",
              "UPDATE",
              "INSERT",
              "DELETE"
            ],
            "App User": [],
            "Administrator": [],
            "Desk_Staff": [],
            "Studio_Lead": [],
            "Studio_Crew": []
          },
          "<id:Gear>": {
            "App Administrator": [
              "SELECT",
              "UPDATE",
              "INSERT",
              "DELETE"
            ],
            "App User": [],
            "Administrator": [],
            "Desk_Staff": [],
            "Studio_Lead": [],
            "Studio_Crew": []
          },
          "<id:Session_Log>": {
            "App Administrator": [
              "SELECT",
              "UPDATE",
              "INSERT",
